          <declname>fieldSizes</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Utilities for constructing DOF-layout structures in finite element assemblies. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Builds a node-field layout from a map of field names to their DOF dimensions.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>fieldSizes</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Map from field name to a pair (dofsPerNode, nodesForField): the number of scalar components the field has at each of its nodes, and how many of the element&apos;s nodes carry that field (&lt;= the element&apos;s total node count for a reduced-order field, e.g. corner- only pressure in a mixed Taylor-Hood-style element). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>A 2-D vector where each row corresponds to a node and each entry is a field name. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
